msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_423170AA_9BC6_400F_8FD8_60750E032EA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫accomplished⟪k:2⟫ something."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ho ottenuto⟪k:2⟫ qualcosa."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9C6ECEBE_D077_4098_BD2B_1FA6B64D6C53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36bce21e4bf6e84d83ba6fedd97fa66fc68280d9c9cc8cd2f628dbb6dc21828b
#. default-sha256: cd6e7b72307a370620ea42ddb2086cfd8c5e7ec2ac00eb00bf735436ce1fa0e4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9C6ECEBE_D077_4098_BD2B_1FA6B64D6C53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sum of everything I did these three days..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La somma di tutto quello che ho fatto in questi tre giorni..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CB3C7978_9C00_4437_A359_E6D28E83A517
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6470856ef6522b23540b6f2dcefac417c1d80af715fea4af2535d6bfea7fd527
#. default-sha256: 0d9389cd641e2533a34533a37d17b891fc5af9e79b72e284a7bc75024f5b7a67
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CB3C7978_9C00_4437_A359_E6D28E83A517"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫should⟪k:2⟫ be enough to change her heart..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫dovrebbe essere sufficiente a cambiare ciò che lei nutre nel proprio cuore..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_856665BF_C630_4CA9_AE54_B340A95F78B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e21888df87d7d39b3ee5ce55df5a4491533df457b9abd75e1e08679245c39f3
#. default-sha256: 170ab59995f9c6a42acad197cc7f9b70c2b760dc3aa388f3d54d0d85acacebc4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_856665BF_C630_4CA9_AE54_B340A95F78B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and change the course of their next lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e a cambiare il corso delle vite future dei tre uomini."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F92CB0CC_84A8_4080_A3E0_B5194806340E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9805e4af41dd866fec7aa5343809314b6b7718e42adf273301c297fbd9dc3c8
#. default-sha256: 9a5883c79921bef91a50a0b899a034c329434ef395706d584887136e00ea372c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F92CB0CC_84A8_4080_A3E0_B5194806340E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They should be able to avoid the tragedies I witnessed through each of their doors."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ora dovrebbero essere in grado di scampare alle tragedie a cui ho assistito durante ognuna "
"delle loro porte."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F93A566A_BD29_44BD_BE2A_8ED6A23FA60F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a297414751d5c37f4b44323d8826ba6f0bdc060fc3a1fc171121a97be6c962c9
#. default-sha256: a32a8e3b5bce60b2ff7cd0104ceacbc03a1ece7401c81a35d4cc33414fe2e560
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F93A566A_BD29_44BD_BE2A_8ED6A23FA60F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫When we step through this door and people see Morgana’s body,⟪k:5⟫we’ll "
"be made to pay for our sins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Appena varcheremo questa soglia e la gente vedrà il corpo di Morgana,"
"⟪k:5⟫verremo condotti a pagare per i nostri peccati."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4E429D64_4256_4431_AEE5_082107636ABC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 230d535546d32e926ff6cd477dd416fd743b28e756b82e28ed576ec027548e7b
#. default-sha256: 6d089828628267af0ea396588941633c7538003a00289e06f2631a247a751047
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4E429D64_4256_4431_AEE5_082107636ABC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ultimately, I’m the one responsible,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so the two of you are welcome to "
"stay behind..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Alla fin fine, sono io l’unico responsabile,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫perciò voi due siete liberi "
"di restare qui..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A6C300C5_C8C4_4A4F_95DA_668A7568FA32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4eb8f26425d2563a02940f1d507ea8795acf208cb626a43761d1f39e2ca119a2
#. default-sha256: bdf02957499e5302f09d1d21de88a56dcdbc0c4e641ebace2c74f305904ae2f7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A6C300C5_C8C4_4A4F_95DA_668A7568FA32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m coming with you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A girl died because of the things I did...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"I can’t just pretend it didn’t have anything to do with me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, io vengo con te.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Per colpa delle mie azioni una ragazza è morta..."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Non posso far finta che questo non mi riguardi..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3D6F1818_603A_4F36_83E6_C18293AF930E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7352cb6a0e7c5585de68ae2f2b57c00ad07527fc8642fad9a78f1c8efa9802de
#. default-sha256: ca38abbe885f5afbe2be57f49736f78b305cd3bd7b3f4aa7a27ecc7c495e41fb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3D6F1818_603A_4F36_83E6_C18293AF930E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, I don’t ⟪k:2⟫want⟪k:3⟫ to."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non voglio⟪k:3⟫ farlo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0EC45386_CC26_4273_9642_877D8503B806
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b907b083dd6bff426668c9ae630da93302626f2317c026e17faba9226eaf3af9
#. default-sha256: a4307051d5cc734dfd2775fc99b685293be7b578bbdd03d1526615080030ddb8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0EC45386_CC26_4273_9642_877D8503B806"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I never had any intention of fleeing.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You may have been the one running "
"the operation,⟪k:5⟫but I did just as many terrible things as you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non ho mai avuto intenzione di fuggire.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Puoi anche aver gestito tu ogni "
"cosa,⟪k:5⟫ma ho fatto cose orribili tanto quanto te."

#: scenario8:scenario8_65A49D97_4226_44D1_B2E7_9F913841121F
