msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D96F361C_877C_4409_8093_134A7AFA2081
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
