msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Say, ⟪k:2⟫uh, ⟪k:3⟫Michel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Dimmi, ⟪k:2⟫ehm, ⟪k:3⟫Michel..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_15D9F7C9_63B1_4D3F_9C17_4A1054182987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
