msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yes?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sì?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0357EF2B_3EF5_4C3A_BAC0_D828E0C3AB1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e37e725c4db1899ab2e0cecb4d061d92c8346c62da764acd37e22adb450629e
#. default-sha256: d24f93f2e98d1e358f5a895aea8783047155fd75c8291a40668d167d9db7ac8d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0357EF2B_3EF5_4C3A_BAC0_D828E0C3AB1A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I figure this is probably my last chance to say it,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so... ⟪k:5⟫thank you "
"for convincing me to hand over my key."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Immagino che questa sia la mia ultima occasione per dirlo,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫perciò, "
"ecco... ⟪k:5⟫ti ringrazio per avermi convinto a darti la mia chiave."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FF87DF36_1317_4F06_B292_9C10C06315C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fbbe07bc0c4a250b20d7fdab12e001d9f017cdb984e4d74916ad68698a4d9bb
#. default-sha256: 032783c6407c17fd046fe75ff73609aeb8a30c1661af21f1a1aa827e2e68224b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FF87DF36_1317_4F06_B292_9C10C06315C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For giving me the courage to open my eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Per avermi dato il coraggio di aprire gli occhi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_00F54393_691B_4C8B_9333_2734C66DD262
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc6ff374cb6fa607c15258eab4a770890066b2f82482f93ba2530cd5e690c61d
#. default-sha256: 48a4a5266af9de40f671cb9b12e2ef1ccc69f292bd364a004f96f71f895679ed
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_00F54393_691B_4C8B_9333_2734C66DD262"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You always had the courage within you, Mell.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You simply needed a "
"little help finding it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hai sempre avuto il coraggio dentro di te, Mell.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Avevi soltanto "
"bisogno di un piccolo aiuto per trovarlo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8083C7A0_A13C_418B_BA18_0C5A13DB5AA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 189c69a70441a08d710d7fb0ea947b72f2a4303cd3a86eed375e414d4c1da4fd
#. default-sha256: 0af0611c3bba6aea672dfd59cd045f39439b3e8241a28dff21b9099dac136bf9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8083C7A0_A13C_418B_BA18_0C5A13DB5AA0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t my strength that allowed you to take action,⟪k:1⟫but your own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non è stata la mia forza a permetterti di agire,⟪k:1⟫ma la tua."

#: scenario8:scenario8_473582DE_B5DC_4205_8803_8FB0FCD38B8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4319083d04e36fc2597fa123d668b0e0bf45ba800fd6c09193707fdff0d1ced7
#. default-sha256: 985c1756435145e17048b48d4d80faeaa239175f1ba23bae3e24add69c46b459
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_473582DE_B5DC_4205_8803_8FB0FCD38B8E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Haha... ⟪k:3⟫you sure know how to make someone feel better about themselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Haha... ⟪k:3⟫di certo sai come far sentire meglio qualcuno⟪k:4⟫riguardo se stesso."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6EFABDF9_3EF4_4C50_B705_EB34C7E70B7D
